<p class="mt-align-center lt-chem-36428"><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>

<p class="lt-chem-36428">Similar analysis can be used to predict the products of other intramolecular aldol reactions. In a similar reaction, 1,4-diketones, such as 2,5-hexanedione, only form the five-membered ring product, ex. 3-methyl-2-cyclopentenone, without any of the possible cyclopropane product forming.</p>

